								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >Make the cursor part of your style</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Magic Cursor</strong> transforms your everyday desktop with visual effects that follow the movement of your mouse. Choose the effect you like, change the atmosphere of your screen, and discover mini-games designed around cursor control.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >From natural phenomena and scientific experiments to magic, technology, and animals, Magic Cursor lets you find a style that matches your mood, game, or desktop.<br><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/79541db732c5b6e0c72fc43097d58805.poster.avif?t=1791842514" width=1170 height=390 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/79541db732c5b6e0c72fc43097d58805.mp4?t=1791842514" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Seven categories — countless different effects</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The Magic Cursor collection is divided into seven themed categories:</p><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Nature</strong> — fire, water, snow, lightning, leaves, minerals, and other natural phenomena.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Mini-Games</strong> — small games where mouse movement becomes your main tool: arcade challenges, reaction tests, dexterity, and precision.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Science</strong> — atoms, molecules, chemical processes, physical phenomena, astronomy, and space-themed effects.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Technology</strong> — digital effects, neon, holograms, electronics, engineering, aerospace technology, and futuristic visuals.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Magic</strong> — runes, spells, potions, portals, fantasy glow, and other mystical effects.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Animals</strong> — real, fantasy, and mythological creatures, tracks, insects, and other effects inspired by the animal world.</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" ><strong>Screen Effects</strong> — full-screen atmospheric scenes featuring weather, leaves, lighting, space, magical, and technological visuals.</p></li></ul><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/cca7928d298410d3f405b8d25507ca9e.poster.avif?t=1791842514" width=1170 height=182 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/cca7928d298410d3f405b8d25507ca9e.mp4?t=1791842514" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >More than cursor effects</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Magic Cursor can change more than just the trail behind your mouse. Enable <strong>screen effects</strong> that work independently of the cursor and transform the atmosphere of your entire desktop.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Combine cursor and screen effects — for example, a magical effect with a night background, snow with a winter atmosphere, or a technological cursor with a futuristic environment.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/bd7a5dc08b13cb49fd026481d3a264f0.poster.avif?t=1791842514" width=1170 height=194 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/bd7a5dc08b13cb49fd026481d3a264f0.mp4?t=1791842514" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Play with your cursor</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Whenever you want a break, launch the built-in mini-games. Control a snake, catch fish, herd sheep, defend the planet, dodge obstacles, and take on other challenges using your mouse movement.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/6005390418940d9c114d3641d4491704.poster.avif?t=1791842514" width=1170 height=304 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5191880/extras/6005390418940d9c114d3641d4491704.mp4?t=1791842514" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
