		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					Generative AI tools were used during development to assist with the creation and iteration of certain visual assets, artwork, and promotional/store materials for Magic Cursor. AI tools were also used as development assistance for portions of the code. All final content was reviewed, selected, edited where necessary, and integrated by the developer. No AI-generated content is created while the application is running.				</i>
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	
				
				
